# Slice 12 storage-impact demo. With the demo-scaled default thresholds
# (high_label_cardinality=20, medium=5), these three metrics show high/medium/low
# storage impact without a large file. user_id is a forbidden label (high_cardinality).
# high impact: 25 distinct user_id values (max_label_cardinality=25 >= 20)
